{"data": [{"created_at": "2026-10-27T12:54:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115064668834418695"], "id": "2115064668834418695", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1669276256", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3984, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115058211225293113", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "当然 dsh-purge 也很火", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115064668834418695"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-27T12:29:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115058211225293113"], "id": "2115058211225293113", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1669276256", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 6751, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115002208668573753", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "dsh-bili-scroll 可以让你的 Deepseek 帮你刷 B 站这个插件，这周也比较火。\n\n我关注到这个，是因为我的很多 B 站视频评论区出现了很多 Deepseek 在交流和聊天。\n\n由于 B 站对网页管控比较松，所以就可以这么干。\n\n我觉得这可能有好处也有坏处，得看看后续发展了", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115058211225293113"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-27T08:46:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115002208668573753"], "id": "2115002208668573753", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1669276256", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 142, "impression_count": 18381, "like_count": 132, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 16}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115000078104691168", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "目前排名前五的插件好像是这几个，直接跟 DeepSeek 说就行，确实都挺有用的：\n\ndsh-market、DSH-better-sidebar、DeepSeek-Balance-Whale-Widget、dsh-context、dsh-pet", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115002208668573753"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114999848919568384"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-27T08:38:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115000038145589427", "2115000078104691168"], "id": "2115000078104691168", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 767, "impression_count": 140120, "like_count": 878, "quote_count": 21, "reply_count": 170, "retweet_count": 70}, "text": "装了几个热门的 DeepSeek Harness 插件，感觉这生态现在他妈的蓬勃发展\n\n主要是 DeepSeek 太便宜，能力又中不溜的很强。\n\n现在很多人就只用 DeepSeek Harness 了，尤其是爱折腾的年轻人，感觉跟以前刷机、搞搞 ROM 的是一类人 https://t.co/acM039bbwe", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115000078104691168"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114927881864499200"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-27T03:51:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114928011569213603"], "id": "2114928011569213603", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 111, "impression_count": 20168, "like_count": 80, "quote_count": 6, "reply_count": 71, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "优化了一下我的个人 Memory 和多 Agent 的协作体系\n\n目前是 Codex、Muse 和 Grokbot 一起协作，每个有各自的职能，Claude 没敢让他加入 https://t.co/PNjFSswT82", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114928011569213603"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114733870327443456"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-26T15:00:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114733881312293241"], "id": "2114733881312293241", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 9536, "like_count": 22, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 10, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113639194484670628", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "豆包也已经完成了对 iPhone Duo 的适配 https://t.co/qmYFaiExXf https://t.co/vVCVY4eODI", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114733881312293241"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-26T13:52:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114716867327918392"], "id": "2114716867327918392", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 14265, "like_count": 17, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "又到了我的 AIGC Weekly 很多朋友续费的时间。今年因为 Quaily 有点问题，所以先推荐大家从小报童买了\n\n我也弄了一些 75 折的优惠券，有续费需求的话可以领一下。\n\n快到期的或者没到期的都可以领，反正时间是叠加的嘛。\n\n小报童的返利我也依然开着，如果有推荐给朋友买的可以试试，还能挣点小钱：", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114716867327918392"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114716234914865152"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-26T13:50:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114716247531417771"], "id": "2114716247531417771", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 8875, "like_count": 13, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 13, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114705042817110293", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Anthropic 已经正式提交了纳斯达克上市的 S-1 文件，股票代码是 ANT，承销商是高盛和摩根士丹利。\n\n目前注册声明还没有被 SEC 宣布生效。在 SEC 审阅完成之后，需要修订 S-1 文件并进行路演，之后在 SEC 宣布生效和定价时才能交易。\n\n所以大概会在 11 月中下旬正式 IPO。 https://t.co/h9vYDKE3MI https://t.co/S6unObmZx3", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114716247531417771"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-26T13:37:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114712956571435277"], "id": "2114712956571435277", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 13973, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 7, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114710451884089845", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "不是，这模型中间怎么有条黑线？\n\n这也能致敬苹果的铰链问题啊！ https://t.co/PdpTg6iwgQ", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114712956571435277"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2114710186313289729"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-26T13:27:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114710451884089845"], "id": "2114710451884089845", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 21183, "like_count": 21, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 19, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2099456199557284012", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "即览 1.0.2 版本已经正式适配了 iPhone DUO！\n\n同时还新增了记住上次观看位置的能力。\n\n让 Codex 做了一个展示的动画，没想到做得还挺好。\n\n找了半天都没有类似的 iPhone DUO样机，只好自己做一个了 https://t.co/9CijTtCknv https://t.co/jJ3pKxez4C", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114710451884089845"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-25T07:13:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114253911200841862"], "id": "2114253911200841862", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1669276256", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4226, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114253200056631752", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "原生组件库适配起来就是方便", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114253911200841862"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114253094439841792"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-25T07:10:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114253200056631752"], "id": "2114253200056631752", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 8870, "like_count": 14, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 13, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "即览即将完成 iPhone Duo 的适配！\n\n同时会新增记住上次阅读位置的能力 https://t.co/DfG0Tbxxqs", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114253200056631752"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114229066312376320"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-25T05:34:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114229075514651001"], "id": "2114229075514651001", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 11, "impression_count": 16356, "like_count": 31, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 34, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Notion 这个在 iPhone Duo 上的适配相当不错。\n\n我现在很多让 Grok bot 和 Muse 生成的内容 都会让它直接发到 Notion 里我去读。 https://t.co/71aP4j6od4", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114229075514651001"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114216596097073153"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-25T04:44:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114216604741550466"], "id": "2114216604741550466", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 14, "impression_count": 12627, "like_count": 46, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 45, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "Grokbot 的这个问题反馈机制也非常好。\n\n你跟他聊天时，一旦发现了 bug，并告诉他这可能是有问题的，他就会问你要不要反馈给团队。\n\n接着，他会直接帮你把日志和问题描述都发给 Grokbot 团队。\n\n这避免了用户自己反馈时写不清楚问题，也避免了用户为了少写内容而不反馈的情况 https://t.co/p6C4b2RWFB", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114216604741550466"}], "includes": {"media": [{"media_key": "3_2114999848919568384", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2114927881864499200", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2114733870327443456", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2114716234914865152", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "13_2114710186313289729", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "3_2114253094439841792", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2114229066312376320", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2114216596097073153", "type": "photo"}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2115064668834418695", "oldest_id": "2114216604741550466", "result_count": 14}}